  "description": "The stress of a demanding father almost drives the fun-loving Kang-Jin to extremes. But he is saved by Jung-Kwon, the class president who excels at everything despite coming from poverty. The boys become bound to one another and fall in love... until Kang-Jin witnesses Jung-Kwon's family caught in a shameful moment. The proud Jung-Kwon cuts ties with Kang-Jin, and their love unravels. Yet countless heartaches and years later, the two find that life has pulled them back together at a host bar... \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
